  "hindi": "देव जातवेदा अग्नि ने तेजों से चमकती हुई उषाओं की ओर देखा है। हे नासत्यौ, हे विस्तीर्ण गति वालो, रथ से हमारे इस यज्ञ के पास आओ।",
  "english": "Jātavedas, the god, Agni, has looked towards the dawns shining with splendours. O Nāsatyas, wide-going, come hither with the chariot, towards this sacrifice of ours.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "pratyagniḥ = prati agniḥ. rocamānāḥ taken as acc. pl. agreeing with uṣasaḥ; nom. pl. is also possible. akhyat 'has looked towards' (prati-√khyā). urugāyā 'wide-going' (also 'widely praised'). naḥ 'of us / to us' (gen. or dat.).",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
