  "hindi": "वे सर्वोत्तम वाहक घोड़े उषा के प्रकाशित होने पर यहाँ तुम दोनों के रथों को ले आएँ। क्योंकि ये सोम तुम दोनों के मधु-पान के लिए हैं; हे वृषभो, इस यज्ञ में आनन्दित होओ।",
  "english": "May those best-carrying horses bring your chariots here at the dawning of the dawn. For these Somas are for you two, for the honey-drinking; O bulls, be exhilarated in this sacrifice.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "vām in line 1 taken as gen. du. 'your (two)' with rathāḥ; ā ... vahantu 'bring hither'. uṣasaḥ vyuṣṭau: uṣasaḥ taken as gen. sg.; gen. or acc. pl. forms are also possible. mādayethām: mid. 2 du., rendered 'be exhilarated'.",
  "confidence": "medium"
